id: SAFE28-3
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: secret_choice
target: crates/web/src/host.rs
find:         shapes_of(&unacknowledged(text, &self.secret_acknowledged))
replace:         shapes_of(&unacknowledged(text, &[]))
expect-fail: keep_saves_every_shape
expect-fail: keep_after_draft_only_warning
note: 保存・書き出しの判定で確認済みを除かない（確認しても保存も書き出しも止まったままになる。SAFE-28）
